    "body": "Relay BB run pushed an update.\n\nPull request: #370\n\nTokens: 0 · Cost: $0.0000\n\nPushed successfully to branch `bb/relay-216-implementation-audit-fixes-10-23-add-d-thr_yg7w6yw8u2`.\n\n## Summary\n\nFixed the CI format-check failure and then discovered/fixed a migration-ordinal collision surfaced while syncing with `develop`: issue #85's `0035_agent_guidance_drift.sql` landed on `develop` while this branch was in flight, colliding with this branch's `0035_doc_history_retention.sql`. Merged `develop` in, renumbered the doc-history migration to `0036_doc_history_retention.sql`, and updated the module manifest, the migration's own header comment, and the manifest-drift test that names it.\n\nAll checks re-verified after the merge:\n- `test:unit` — 25 files / 177 tests passed\n- `test:integration` — 81 files / 912 tests passed\n- `test:e2e` — 1 file / 5 tests passed\n- Workspace-wide `tsc --noEmit` — clean\n- `eslint .` — clean\n- `prettier --check` — clean\n- `check-migration-numbering` — 36 migration files, all unique ordinals\n\nRelay-Step-Status: pass",
